{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:14.55.150","page_type":"section"},"citation":"14.55.150","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","content_hash":"5194ced87cf8bd31730206ec8e6b587a14d6a20a584e087e32610acf033c1e9e","heading":"Schedule of permit fees – Waiver.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.150:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","text":"Section R108.2, Schedule of permit fees, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:\n(a) On buildings, structures, electrical, gas, mechanical and plumbing systems or alterations requiring a permit, a fee as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule for each permit shall be paid as required, for the following types of construction:\nNew construction (this includes all permit fees):\nType construction\nSingle-family and duplex\n0 – 1,500\n1,501 – 3,000\n3,001 and over\nType construction\nSingle-family and duplex\n0 – 1,500\n1,501 – 3,000\n3,001 and over\nRoom additions (this includes all fees):\nArea (sq. ft.)\n0 – 100\n101 – 250\n251 – 500\n501 – 750\n751 – 1,000\n1,001 or more\nArea (sq. ft.)\n0 – 100\n101 – 250\n251 – 500\n501 – 750\n751 – 1,000\n1,001 or more\nGarage additions (this includes all fees):\nType\nSingle\nDouble\nTriple\nType\nSingle\nDouble\nTriple\nAccessory structure: Only building fee: $30.00.\nInterior alteration (building fee only):\nCost\n$0.00 – $500.00\n$501.00 – $5,000.00\n$5,001.00 – $10,000.00\n$10,001.00 and over\nCost\n$0.00 – $500.00\n$501.00 – $5,000.00\n$5,001.00 – $10,000.00\n$10,001.00 and over\n(b) Working without permit. Whenever work that requires a permit has commenced without a permit, an amount equal to twice the normal permit fee shall be paid before the permit is issued.\n(c) Investigation fee. All site investigations made by inspectors of work going on without permits will require an additional investigation fee as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule, in addition to any other fees, be added to the final permit fee if it is determined that the work being done at the site does indeed require a permit and no application has been made.\n(d) The City Manager is authorized to consider fee waivers in cases of: (1) emergency situations; and (2) affordable or charitable housing projects where materials and labor are donated.\n(Ord. 20631 § 54, 1-13-26.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"fdff6382-5786-5aa5-a788-8485b1b307b8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.55.150","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","content_hash":"9b531bf3deccb080acd699523ffaa4da3efcd088e30ffb610e313dfb04751261","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.150:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.150:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","text":"Section R108.2, Schedule of permit fees, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"561f9dbd-7a83-5643-9ab6-7b57ab88bbdd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.55.150","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","content_hash":"d70225aba93a9dc5f02f4508aca31e1dc5528f0af17a1ad0a5bd697f5f94ee7e","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.150:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.150:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.55.150","text":"(a) On buildings, structures, electrical, gas, mecha